# What the kura package needs from Debian (its Depends), one package a line.
# A package added here reaches devices that upgrade, not only new images
# (ADR-030). Keep it short: what is here cannot be removed without removing
# kura. kura.local is switched off in hardening.json ("mdns": false), not by
# removing avahi.
bash
jq
systemd
# kura.local on the local network
avahi-daemon
